{
  "why": [
    "Never render a config value (F44-064 b), read by both languages: Go's",
    "renderValue (cli/internal/report/report.go: text, SARIF, every report) and",
    "Python's render_value (shared/culprit_model/capture_diff.py: every API",
    "response about a stored fact). A shape is rendered as its closed fields; a",
    "config subject's value never is, granted or not, except a boolean; any",
    "other subject's value is canonical JSON. The config branch is decided by",
    "the subject, and a subject that does not parse is treated as a config one:",
    "the safe direction for a renderer whose one job is not to print a value."
  ],
